import AppDocs from '../../../layouts/AppDocs.astro';
import { stampShift, supportEmail } from '../../../data/apps';
---
<AppDocs app={stampShift} active="support" title="Stamp Shift support" description="Stamp Shift rules, help with blocked routes, and instructions for restoring Extra Routes." heading="A little help at the desk." intro="Learn the rules, find a way through a blocked route, or get help with Extra Routes.">
  <section><h2>How to play</h2><ol><li><strong>Match.</strong> Read the manifest from left to right. Tap a queue when its front stamp matches the next stamp's symbol and name.</li><li><strong>Hold.</strong> On routes with a pocket, choose Hold and tap a queue with a nonmatching front stamp. It waits in the pocket. Tap the pocket when that stamp is next.</li><li><strong>Reverse.</strong> On routes with reversal, choose Reverse and tap a nonempty queue. Its order flips. You have one reversal per route.</li></ol><p>Open <strong>Learn the desk</strong> on the home screen for three short, replayable lessons. Undo, restart and hints are always free.</p></section>
  <section><h2>Common questions</h2>
    <details><summary>My route is blocked. What can I do?</summary><p>Tap Hint for help in three stages: a concept, a useful target, then the exact next move. If there is no solution from here, Undo a move or restart the attempt.</p></details>
    <details><summary>What does Extra Routes include?</summary><p>The first 30 routes are free. One permanent in-app purchase unlocks 70 additional routes. There is no subscription. The app shows Apple's current localized price before purchase.</p></details>
    <details><summary>How do I restore Extra Routes?</summary><p>Open Choose a route and select a route marked Paid. In The post shop, choose Restore purchases using the Apple Account that bought Extra Routes. A connection to Apple may be needed. If nothing is found, check that account and try again.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Where is my progress saved?</summary><p>Your current route, move history, delivered routes and sound/haptic settings are saved locally on this device. There is no cloud sync. Deleting the app can remove local progress. Replaying a delivered route does not erase its completed status.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Can I play without an account?</summary><p>Yes. Stamp Shift has no in-app login, advertising or analytics. Apple handles any purchase authentication and payment. Read the <a href="/apps/stamp-shift/privacy">privacy policy</a> for details.</p></details>
  </section>
  <section><h2>Tell me where you got stuck.</h2><p class="docs-contact">Email <a href={`mailto:${supportEmail}?subject=Stamp%20Shift%20support`}>{supportEmail}</a>. Include the route, what you expected, what happened, your device/iOS version and app version. Please don't send passwords or payment details.</p><p>With a route open, choose <strong>Help &amp; privacy → Share puzzle information</strong>. Review the route title/ID, manifest progress, move count and history, and app version/build in Apple's share sheet. You decide whether to send it and to whom. Nothing is sent to me automatically.</p></section>
</AppDocs>
